# Route circuit_analog — the circuit route (circuit.pad: race on a street circuit, leave from the pause menu, its replay plays) without its
# digital accelerator hold (CROSS:1800): only an analog throttle (analog-pedals, GT_MOD_PEDALS_FAKE) drives the car, so its replay
# shows whether the replay recorded the analog throttle (tools/mod_pedals_check.sh --replay).
